infinite-patch 1
# First sound: press play and hear notes
node 1 Notes Random Note Generator
  id notes
  pos 0 1062
end
node 2 Synths Analog
  id synth
  pos 480 1062
  f volume 0.5
end
node 3 Utility Audio Out
  id speakers
  pos 1340 1040
end
node 4 Modulators Audio Analyze
  id ana
  pos 0 2222
end
node 5 Source Shape
  id pic
  pos 0 162
  c fillColor 1 0.45 0.3
  f size 0.2
end
node 6 Utility Output
  id out
  pos 460 0
end
node 7 Compositing Comment
  pos 0 722
  s text First sound. Notes go into a synth, the synth goes to the speakers. Follow the wires left to right.
  f width 340
  f height 120
end
node 8 Compositing Comment
  pos 0 878
  s text The Notes box plays a new random note every quarter beat. Try changing Rate, or the Low and High note range.
  f width 300
  f height 148
end
node 9 Compositing Comment
  pos 480 878
  s text The Analog synth turns each note into a sound. Try turning Volume down or changing the Wave of oscillator 1.
  f width 300
  f height 148
end
node 10 Compositing Comment
  pos 1340 878
  s text Audio Out sends the sound to your speakers. Every sound needs to reach one of these.
  f width 300
  f height 126
end
node 11 Compositing Comment
  pos 0 0
  s text A small picture that follows the sound, so you can see it as well as hear it.
  f width 300
  f height 126
end
note synth 0 notes
aud speakers 0 synth
aud ana 0 synth
cable out 0 pic
mod pic sizeX ana 0 0 1 0.5 0.12 0.4
mod pic sizeY ana 0 0 1 0.5 0.12 0.4
